





:DOCNUM.0083  :TITLE.CPWATCH  :BODY  CPWATCH  is  an  online
resource usage monitor for VM/370.   It displays in realtime
enough  about  the  current  activity  of  CP  to  allow  an
intuitive grasp  of system load,   gross conflict,   and the
currently active users.   This version, 4.3,  is operational
on VM/SP1, 2, and 3, VM/HPO 3.0 and 3.2,  and should work on
BSEP  2 and  VM/370  Release 6.    It  now  includes a  VMCF
interface  to  allow access  to  the  display screens  by  a
logged-on   CMS   user.     :AUTHOR.Gary   George   :ADDRESS
:ALINE.Workers' Compensation Board of Alberta, :ALINE.9912 -
107 Street, Edmonton, Alberta  T5J 2S5 :ALINE.(403) 427-1013
